flowchart TD
    INPUT([Human request]) --> DETECT{Existing application code?}
    IDEA([Optional brainstorm: generate, critique, select and detail ideas]) -. Selected brief .-> INPUT
    DETECT -->|No: new application| BA
    DETECT -->|Yes: existing system| SURVEY
    SURVEY((Code Surveyor)) --> SV((Survey Validator))
    SV -. Revise .-> SURVEY
    SV --> TRIAGE([Human triage: confirm scope and tier])
    TRIAGE -. Survey changes .-> SURVEY
    TRIAGE -->|Bug fix / small change| FIX
    TRIAGE -->|New feature: deep survey, single change| FBA
    TRIAGE -->|New feature: deep survey, split into phases| BA

    subgraph PROGRAM[Program planning: once per program]
      BA((Business Analyst)) --> BAV((BA Validator))
      BAV -. Revise .-> BA
      BAV --> BAH([Human requirements approval])
      BAH -. Changes .-> BA
      BAH -->|Approved| PP((Phase Planner))
      PP --> PPV((Planner Validator))
      PPV -. Revise .-> PP
      PPV --> PPH([Human phase-plan approval])
      PPH -. Changes .-> PP
    end
    PPH -->|Approved: create phase| ARCH
    FBA((Change-run Business Analyst)) --> FBAV((BA Validator))
    FBAV -. Revise .-> FBA
    FBAV --> FBAH([Human requirements approval])
    FBAH -. Changes .-> FBA
    FBAH -->|Approved| ARCH

    ARCH((Architect)) --> ARV((Architect Validator))
    ARV -. Revise .-> ARCH
    ARV --> ARH([Human technical-spec approval])
    ARH -. Technical change .-> ARCH
    ARH -. Requirements: scoped BA reopen and reapproval .-> REQ([Requirements owner: program BA or change-run BA])
    REQ --> ARCH
    ARH -->|Approved| TL((Technical Lead))
    TL --> TLV((Tech Lead Validator))
    TLV -. Revise .-> TL
    TLV --> TLH([Human stories approval])
    TLH -. Changes .-> TL
    TLH -->|Approved| AUTHOR
    FIX((Fix Planner)) --> FIXV((Fix-plan Validator))
    FIXV -. Revise .-> FIX
    FIXV --> FIXH([Human fix-plan approval])
    FIXH -. Changes .-> FIX
    FIXH -->|Approved: synthesize stories| AUTHOR
    AUTHOR([Helper: generate eval manifest from story criteria]) --> EH([Human eval review])
    EH -. Local check-kind change: redisplay .-> EH
    EH -. Criterion change: feature/program .-> TL
    EH -. Criterion change: fix/small change .-> FIX
    EH -. Technical change: if this route has an Architect .-> ARCH
    EH -. Requirements change: if this route has a BA .-> REQ
    EH -->|Approved: freeze specification| ENG

    subgraph DEV[One story at a time: dependency wave, then story ID]
      ENG((Track Engineer)) --> CR((Code Reviewer))
      CR -. Code issues .-> ENG
      CR -->|Pass| TE((Test Engineer))
      TE --> TR((Test Reviewer))
      TR -. Test issues .-> TE
      TR -. Production defect .-> ENG
      TR -->|Tests pass| CHECK([Helper: scan tags and check criterion coverage])
      CHECK -. Missing test binding .-> TE
      CHECK -->|Story passes, more remain| ENG
    end
    CHECK -->|All stories complete| CORPUS([Promote evals and replay permanent test-link corpus])
    CORPUS -. Regression: repair affected story .-> ENG
    CORPUS -. Intentional change .-> RETIRE([Reviewed retire / supersede, then replay])
    RETIRE --> CORPUS
    CORPUS -->|Pass| INFRA{New build or infrastructure change required?}
    INFRA -->|No: permitted brownfield skip| DONE
    INFRA -->|Yes| TYPE{Application type}
    TYPE -->|Web| DO((DevOps Engineer))
    DO --> DOR((DevOps Reviewer))
    DOR -. Config issue .-> DO
    DOR -. Owning story bug: code and full tests, then retry final stage .-> ENG
    TYPE -->|Electron / embedded| PK((Track Packager))
    PK --> PKR((Packager Reviewer))
    PKR -. Packaging issue .-> PK
    PKR -. Owning story bug: code and full tests, then retry final stage .-> ENG
    DOR -->|Verified| DONE([Run complete: branch ready for review])
    PKR -->|Verified| DONE
    DOR -. Ambiguity .-> HUMAN([Human guidance])
    PKR -. Ambiguity .-> HUMAN
    LIMIT([Any bounded review loop reaches five iterations]) --> HUMAN
    HUMAN -. Resume affected loop with guidance .-> RESUME([Affected creator / reviewer loop])
    DONE --> PR([Human opens, reviews and merges PR])
    PR --> NEXT{Program has remaining phases?}
    NEXT -->|No / flat change run| SHIPPED([Delivered])
    NEXT -->|Yes: next-phase and merge confirmation| REPLAN{Replan remaining phases?}
    REPLAN -->|Keep| ARCH
    REPLAN -->|Replan| PP
    FREEZE([After eval approval: upstream spec edits are blocked; cancel and start a new run])
    LIMITS([Helper checks bindings; tests run separately. assert/judge execution is not implemented.])

    classDef agent fill:#eff6ff,stroke:#0caee0,color:#334155
    classDef reviewer fill:#f0fdfa,stroke:#087f9f,color:#334155
    classDef human fill:#fff7ed,stroke:#ce731b,color:#334155
    class BA,PP,FBA,ARCH,TL,FIX,SURVEY,ENG,TE,DO,PK agent
    class BAV,PPV,FBAV,ARV,TLV,FIXV,SV,CR,TR,DOR,PKR reviewer
    class TRIAGE,BAH,PPH,FBAH,ARH,TLH,FIXH,EH,HUMAN,PR human
